        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You don't need to actually do damage with the stun bolt for the debuff to affect it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>hm well… this whole 'read the card' thing is actually pretty underrated!</p>",
