      {
        "id": 159437,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-09T21:16:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had Chrono Ranger on damage duty while Legs, Haka, and Bunker tanked. &nbsp;I took out the Drum the same turn the Grimoire came out (Ultimate Target is great!), but then (like everyone else) I got hit with Main Computer Room into Fixed Point, Vast Following, Cursed Acolyte, and Profane Zealot. &nbsp;But Atlantean Throne Room + Heavy Plating/Fortitude/Ta Moko + Lead From the Front + Smoke Bombs spread the damage around pretty thinly, so I did okay. &nbsp;Then some focused fire on the Pouch of Bones, and a Rampage to clear the board, and I was back in business. &nbsp;Hunter &amp; Hunted + Compounded Bow &amp; Masada brought Gloomy down pretty quickly after that.</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:39:44.526Z",
