      {
        "id": 159439,
        "name": "Reverend Pete",
        "username": "Reverend_Pete",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-10T01:18:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I timed (by accident) a ground pound on the turn that fixed point came out, which was followed by the third relic's appearance, which flipped Gloomweaver...so he had two rounds of not dealing any damage. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Chrono had 5 bounties out by that point... With hunter and hunted+bow+ground pound+One-shots+legacy selecting CR for an extra power use, he was able to deal 40+ damage in each of two consecutive rounds, while not taking any damage in return.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Needless to say, that was the end of Gloomweaver.</p>",
