      {
        "id": 159442,
        "name": "Jgraygaming2",
        "username": "Jgraygaming2",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/34f0e0/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-10T12:14:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"morph147\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/839c29/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> morph147:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>My group did it the long way. We ended up defeating gloomweaver by hitting her a lot with what damage chrono could do each turn. Someone put one of the relics on the bottom of the deck so had to go that route</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It was a strange game to be sure but I enjoyed going the long way around. The first time I played the scenario we took out the relics quickly thanks to smart uses to throat jab and Legacy denying draws to Gloomweaver.</p>",
