      {
        "id": 159443,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-11T02:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Man, this one was easy. Everyone ended in their 20s, and even the Profane Zealot barely made a dent, thanks to Legacy having Next Evolution'd himself against Infernal, Lead from the Front, the Atlantean Throne Room and everyone's armor. I didn't even bother attacking the relics for the most part, since all the Stun Bolts and Darts kept Gloomy from doing much of anything. Once Legacy got NE and LftF out, I was able to let the Throneroom die and then it was swiftly downhill for Gloomy, with Greatest Legacy finishing things with a good Thokking.</p><p>I feel like Bunker was basically useless, though -- Gloomweaver didn't get any of his Ongoings out, so his base power went totally unused, and he just kind of sat there healing for most of the game. The only offensive power he got out was the Omnicannon right near the end and he used it all of once.</p>",
        "post_number": 28,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:39:44.977Z",
