        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/stevelabny/{size}/2536_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-12T13:36:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I plowed right through this one.</p><p>Used Bunker's Combustion to wipe the zombies turn 1 while everyone else focused on the drum. Got Inpsiring Presence out early, and had Chrono put the bounty on Gloomweaver that gave Chrono a free shot every turn when Gloomy did damage.&nbsp; Figured on advanced mode with 5, the trick would be to wipe all 3 relics on the same turn, so I played an early Take Down and another when I was down to 2 relics in play (I had to eventually drop the drum because I didn't want Gloomy to flip.)&nbsp; Chrono was a ping-beast like always, Wraith did her share of batarang damage, Legacy was Legacy, and Haka finished it off with a Rampage.</p><p>Everyone was pretty comfortable in teens or low 20s in HP and that was after that buffed Rampage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 30,
