        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-12T22:07:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I suffered my first defeat.&nbsp; Stupid Computer Room.</p><p>The second time I did it right and got all three relics in the trash.&nbsp; This was my first time with Chrono-Ranger and I couldn't get him to do much.&nbsp; I have much to learn about his mechanics.</p><p>This was my least favorite of the one-shots so far - not because I lost it (once), but because it forced me into a grinding kind of game that I do not enjoy.</p>",
